# iio-sensor-proxy with libssc (ADSP sensor core): accelerometer mount matrix for the Redmi Note 10 (mojito).
# The sensor is mounted rotated 180 degrees in the board plane: X and Y inverted, Z as is. Measured 2026-11-27: without a
# matrix upright reports "bottom-up"; with "1, 0, 0; 0, -1, 0; 0, 0, -1" portrait was right but landscape was swapped.
SUBSYSTEM=="misc", KERNEL=="fastrpc-*", ENV{ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX}+="-1, 0, 0; 0, -1, 0; 0, 0, 1"
